@startuml sequence_validation
actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "API Controller" as API
participant "Security / Policy" as Policy
participant "Validation Service" as Validation
database "Temporary Storage" as Storage
participant "Evaluation Service" as Evaluation

User -> UI : Select model/dataset
UI -> API : Upload artifacts
API -> Policy : Check auth + policy
Policy --> API : Allowed
API -> Validation : Validate type, size, structure
Validation -> Policy : Check limits / allowed values
Policy --> Validation : Check result

alt Valid input
  Validation --> API : Validated artifacts
  API -> Storage : Store with server-controlled path
  Storage --> API : Artifact reference
  API -> Evaluation : Pass validated reference
  Evaluation --> API : Ready
  API --> UI : Validation successful
else Invalid input
  Validation --> API : Validation error
  API --> UI : Safe error response
  UI --> User : Explain correction
end
@enduml
